UID:b61ba47f318d31059beedf379ea05bd0@visitsantarosa.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a group ride from Sports Basement! We 
 meet on the last Sunday of the month at 9am inside the store and start the
  ride at 9:15am. Most routes are 30-40 miles and all rides are no-drop\, m
 eaning we won’t leave any rider behind. Regular updates can be found on 
 our Strava Page (search for: Sports Basement Santa Rosa Rides) Feel free t
 o call the store with any questions at 707-921-3151. Hope to see you there
 !\n\nCategories: Community Events\, Free\, Sports & Recreation
LOCATION:Sports Basement Santa Rosa\, 1970 Santa Rosa Ave\, Santa Rosa\, C
 A 95407
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/group-rides-with-sports-basement/
X-SOURCE:Visit Santa Rosa
END:VEVENT
